      "name": "ReleaseCompositeUnit",
      "signature": "void ReleaseCompositeUnit(void * pUnit, int nRemoveFromList)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Releases a composite unit and all associated COF (Component Object File) nodes.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate unit pointer and graphics info pointer (assert if null)\n2. Traverse linked list of COF node references from graphics info\n3. For each COF node, decrement ref count and release if count reaches 0\n4. Unlink released COF nodes from global g_piCofNodeList doubly-linked list\n5. Release pool allocations for COF link entries\n6. Clear graphics info pointer and release cached cel graphics via Ordinal_10041\n7. If fRemoveFromList is set, unlink unit from g_pCompositeUnitList\n\nParameters:\n- pUnit (void*): Pointer to composite unit structure (offset 0xB8 = GfxInfo, 0xBC = CelFile, 0xC4/0xC8 = list links)\n- fRemoveFromList (int): If non-zero, remove unit from global composite unit list\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xB8: Offset to graphics info pointer in unit\n- 0xBC: Offset to cel file pointer in unit\n- 0xC4/0xC8 (196/200): Prev/next pointers for composite unit list\n- 0x18/0x1C (24/28): Prev/next pointers for COF node list\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Ordinal_10041: Releases cel graphics cache\n- ReleasePoolAllocation: Fog memory pool deallocation",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:4747742d70a08f5260118af5016731e7",
