      "name": "HandleInventoryType9",
      "signature": "void HandleInventoryType9(int * pInvList)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Handles inventory type 9 item cleanup and destruction.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate item type (must be 9)\n2. Call cleanup handler at offset 0x50\n3. Delete associated file if deletion not disabled\n4. Process inventory item removal\n5. Return\n\nParameters:\n- pInvList (int*): Pointer to inventory item structure with type=9\n  Field at offset 0x00: Type field (must equal 9)\n  Field at offset 0x10: File path to delete\n  Field at offset 0x50: Cleanup handler offset\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x09: Expected inventory item type\n- 0x10 (16): Offset to file path string\n- 0x50 (80): Offset to cleanup handler pointer\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Ordinal_10018 (dispatch), Ordinal_10038 (cleanup), ProcessInventoryItem",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "EXP",
      "index": "EXP:3",
