      "name": "OnButtonPressed",
      "signature": "dword OnButtonPressed(int * pBtn, int nDelta)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Validates and invokes button press callback if state conditions are met.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if button type is 0x6\n2. Verify button flags match required bit masks\n3. Check button state fields (0x44, 0x48) are zero\n4. Validate nDelta against flag bits (0x40): positive with bit 0x8, negative with bit 0x10\n5. Clear 28-byte local array via REP STOSD\n6. Increment global counter DAT_6f961530\n7. Call button callback at offset 0x34 with pBtn\n8. Decrement global counter and return 0\n\nParameters:\n- pBtn (int*): Button structure pointer\n- nDelta (int): Delta value (positive/negative)\n\nReturns:\n- 0 always\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x6: Button type constant\n- 0x40: Flags field offset in structure\n- 0x44, 0x48: State field offsets",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:052a101a230c3ddc22bbf8ff66201a19",
