      "name": "CreateUIElementType1",
      "signature": "void CreateUIElementType1(dword dwX, dword dwY, dword dwType, dword dwWidth, dword dwHeight, dword dwBgColor, dword dwFlags, dword dwFgColor, dword dwUnknown, dword dwExFlags, dword * pdwInitData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Create UI element of type 1. Allocates and initializes a 0x284-byte structure with display parameters.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 0x284 bytes via FogMemAlloc\n2. Zero-initialize entire structure (161 dwords)\n3. Set type field to 1\n4. Initialize display fields: position (dwX, dwY), dimensions, colors\n5. Set function pointers for rendering based on dwFlags bit 3\n6. Copy initial data from pdwInitData if provided\n7. Call initialization function FUN_6f90ea50\n\nParameters:\n- dwX: X coordinate position\n- dwY: Y coordinate position\n- dwType: Element type (stored but semantic type TBD)\n- dwWidth: Width in pixels\n- dwHeight: Height in pixels\n- dwBgColor: Background color value\n- dwFlags: Control flags (bit 3 selects render function)\n- dwFgColor: Foreground color value\n- dwUnknown: Purpose unclear, stored at offset 0xd*4\n- dwExFlags: Extended flags (stored at offset 0x98*4)\n- pdwInitData: Optional init data (2 dwords copied to offset 0x9c/0x9d)\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to allocated UI element structure (0x284 bytes)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x284 (644): Structure size in bytes\n- 0xa1 (161): Number of dwords to zero-initialize\n- 0x100: Default value for field at offset 0x12*4\n- 0xffffffff: Initialization value for field at offset 0x15*4",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:3c4c759b7761bf14ff36ec0b4c321f80",
