      "name": "GetFontPath",
      "signature": "void GetFontPath(int nFontId, char * szOutputBuffer, int nBufferSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Constructs the full font file path based on font ID and locale.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Create temporary buffer for full path using format string\n2. Calculate string length of intermediate result\n3. Validate buffer size against required space\n4. Select appropriate font pointer based on font ID and locale\n5. Format final output path with selected font data\n\nParameters:\n- nFontId (int): Font identifier index (0-12, special case 0xd)\n- szOutputBuffer (char*): Output buffer for full path string\n- nBufferSize (int): Size of output buffer\n\nReturns:\n- void (modifies szOutputBuffer in-place)\n\nDependencies:\n- DAT_6f9614f2: Locale flag\n- PTR_s_Font8_6f91d530: Font pointer array\n- PTR_s_FontInGameChat_6f91d564: Chat font pointer",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
