      "name": "ImageData_ValidateAndSetFields",
      "signature": "void ImageData_ValidateAndSetFields(int * pImageData, int nFieldValue2, int nFieldValue3)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Validates and sets image data fields.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate that pImageData points to type 2 structure\n2. Assert on type mismatch and terminate process\n3. Set field at offset 0xc (param [3]) to nFieldValue2\n4. Set field at offset 0x10 (param [4]) to nFieldValue3\n5. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n- pImageData (int *): Pointer to image structure; [0] must equal 2\n- nFieldValue2 (int): Value for field at offset 0xc\n- nFieldValue3 (int): Value for field at offset 0x10\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success\n- Does not return on type validation failure (FUN_6f91436d terminates)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:052a101a230c3ddc22bbf8ff66201a19",
