      "name": "GetListValue",
      "signature": "dword GetListValue(D2WIN_LIST * pListData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Returns value from D2WIN_LIST structure after validating type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Verify pListData->dwType equals 7 (D2WIN_LIST type marker)\n2. If type mismatch, call FogAssert with error location info\n3. Call AssertFailure(0xffffffff) to terminate on type error\n4. Extract and return dword value at offset 0x50\n\nParameters:\n- pListData (D2WIN_LIST*): Pointer to D2WIN_LIST structure\n\nReturns:\n- dword: Value from list data at offset 0x50 (dwValue field)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 7: D2WIN_LIST type constant\n- 0x50 (80): Byte offset to dwValue field",
