      "name": "DispatchTextListCallback",
      "signature": "uint DispatchTextListCallback(int * pWidget)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Dispatches callback for text list widget items based on type match.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate widget type equals 7 (TEXT_LIST type), assert on mismatch\n2. Get linked list head from widget offset 0x64 ([0x19])\n3. For each item in linked list:\n   - Compare item type byte at offset 0x218 with widget[2] (callback type)\n   - If match and callback pointer at offset 0x204 exists:\n     - Invoke callback with widget parameter\n     - Return callback result\n   - Otherwise follow next pointer at offset 0x220\n4. Return 0 if no matching callback found\n\nParameters:\n- pWidget: Pointer to text list widget structure (type 7)\n  - [0]: Widget type (must equal 7)\n  - [2]: Target callback type identifier (byte value)\n  - [0x19] (offset 0x64): Head of text item linked list\n\nReturns:\n- Non-zero: Result from callback function if match found\n- 0: No matching item or callback handler\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 7: TEXT_LIST widget type constant\n- 0x64 (offset 0x19*4): Linked list head in widget structure\n- 0x204: Callback function pointer offset in text item\n- 0x218: Type identifier byte offset in text item\n- 0x220: Next pointer offset in text item linked list\n\nStructure Layout (Text Item at offset 0x200+):\nOffset  Size  Field           Type    Description\n0x204   4     pfnCallback     code*   Item callback function pointer\n0x218   1     bType           byte    Item type identifier for dispatch\n0x220   4     pNext           void*   Next item in linked list\n\nClassification: Callback dispatcher - routes events to matching text list items",
