      "name": "DispatchInventoryItemHandler",
      "signature": "uint DispatchInventoryItemHandler(uint * pdwInventoryType)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Dispatches inventory item type handler and clears reference.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input pointer (NULL check) - return 0 if null\n2. Dereference to get inventory list structure pointer\n3. Validate list pointer (NULL check) - return 0 if null\n4. Extract item type from first dword of list\n5. Dispatch to appropriate handler via switch table (types 1-12)\n6. Clear input pointer to null after handling\n7. Return handler result\n\nParameters:\n- pdwInventoryType (uint*): Pointer to inventory type/reference to handle\n\nReturns:\n- Handler return value (typically 0), varies by item type\n- 0 if input or list pointer is null\n\nSwitch Cases:\n- 1: InventoryHandleType1\n- 2,3,5,8,10: ProcessInventoryItemWrapper\n- 4: ProcessTextData\n- 6: InventoryHandleType6\n- 7: ReleaseListAllocations\n- 9: HandleInventoryType9\n- 12: ReleaseInventoryList\n- default: returns 0",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
