      "name": "LoadPaletteData",
      "signature": "uint LoadPaletteData(uint dwPaletteId, uint dwModeId)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Loads palette data from WAD files and initializes color mapping tables.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load base palette (256 colors, 3-byte RGB) from WAD file dwPaletteId via Ordinal_10038/FUN_6f913fa2\n2. Copy palette into local buffer abPaletteBuffer with 4-byte stride (RGB + padding)\n3. Load mode-specific palette tables from WAD file dwModeId via Ordinal_10038/FUN_6f913fa2\n4. Copy 11 pre-allocated palette subtables from loaded data to global memory (256 colors to 49152 entries)\n5. Initialize all color table entries in DAT_6f9c5997 with value 5\n6. Build color lookup tables via FindClosestColorMatch() for palette matching\n\nParameters:\n- dwPaletteId (ECX): Palette ID from resource WAD file\n- dwModeId (EDX): Mode identifier for palette subtables\n- IMPLICIT: EBX contains base context pointer\n\nReturns:\n- 1 (success constant)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
