      "name": "SetScrollbarPosition",
      "signature": "int SetScrollbarPosition(int * pScrollbar, int nPosition)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Sets scrollbar position if valid type detected.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Verify scrollbar type field equals 5 (scrollbar type)\n2. Assert failure if type mismatch\n3. Validate position value > 0\n4. Store position at offset 0x48 if valid, otherwise store 0\n5. Always returns 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n- pScrollbar (int*): Pointer to scrollbar structure; offset 0 = type, offset 0x48 = position\n- nPosition (int): New position value to set if positive\n\nReturns:\n- 1 (always succeeds)",
