      "comment": "Retrieves the current value from a scrollbar control.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Verify the scrollbar control structure (validate type field equals 5)\n2. If type check fails, trigger assertion and invoke abort handler\n3. Dereference scrollbar pointer to get offset 0x4c (value field)\n4. Return the value\n\nParameters:\n- pScrollbar (void*): Pointer to scrollbar control structure\n\nReturns:\n- int: Current scrollbar value from structure offset 0x4c (0-based range)\n\nNotes:\n- Asserts if pScrollbar does not point to valid scrollbar (type != 5)\n- Called from UI event handlers to retrieve user input values",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
