      "name": "ResetScrollbarStateFields",
      "signature": "bool ResetScrollbarStateFields(ScrollbarObject * pScrollbar)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "bool",
      "comment": "Resets scrollbar state tracking fields to zero.\n\nNOTE: Function body is malformed in Ghidra (single instruction visible).\nManual recreation needed to fix boundaries. Full code extends to 0x6f91106d.\n\nClassification: Callback - invoked from scrollbar objects (stored at +0x28)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get scrollbar object pointer from stack parameter [ESP+4]\n2. Dereference to get pointer to ScrollbarObject structure\n3. Verify dwObjectType field == 5 (scrollbar type), assert fatal if not\n4. Check if dwStateField1 (offset 0x40) is non-zero\n5. Check if dwStateField2 (offset 0x44) is non-zero\n6. Check if dwStateField3 (offset 0x58) is non-zero\n7. If all three fields are zero, return FALSE (nothing to reset)\n8. If any field is non-zero, clear all three state fields to zero\n9. Return TRUE indicating state was reset\n\nParameters:\n- pScrollbar (ScrollbarObject*): Pointer to scrollbar UI object structure\n\nReturns:\n- TRUE (1): State fields were non-zero and have been cleared\n- FALSE (0): All state fields were already zero, no action taken\n\nScrollbarObject Structure Layout:\nOffset  Size  Field            Type    Description\n+0x00   4     dwObjectType     uint    Must be 5 for scrollbar\n+0x04   4     dwStyle          uint    Style flags\n+0x08   4     dwFlags          uint    Bit mask flags\n+0x0C   4     nX               int     X position\n+0x10   4     nY               int     Y position\n+0x14   4     nWidth           int     Width\n+0x18   4     nHeight          int     Height\n+0x1C   4     pfnCallback1     void*   First callback function\n+0x24   4     pfnMouseHandler  void*   ProcessScrollbarMousePos\n+0x28   4     pfnStateCallback void*   This function (ResetScrollbarStateFields)\n+0x34   4     nIndex           int     Index value\n+0x40   4     dwStateField1    uint    First tracked state value\n+0x44   4     dwStateField2    uint    Second tracked state value\n+0x58   4     dwStateField3    uint    Third tracked state value\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 5: Object type ID for scrollbar\n- 0x1B0 (432): Assert error code (source line number)\n\nCross-References:\n- CreateScrollbarObject stores this callback at object +0x28\n- ProcessScrollbarMousePos stored at +0x24 for mouse input handling",
