      "name": "ValidateEntityTypeAndCallFunction",
      "signature": "uint ValidateEntityTypeAndCallFunction(int * pEntity)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Validates entity type is 0x9 and calls entity's function pointer if permitted.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load entity type from first field and verify it equals 0x9\n2. Perform permission checks using gdwBitMasks flags (bits at +0x8)\n3. If both permission flags are set, call function pointer at offset 0x34 with entity as parameter\n4. Return result from function pointer, or 0 if validation failed or no callback set\n\nParameters:\n- pEntity (int*): Pointer to entity structure with type field at offset 0, permission flags at offset 0x8, and callback function pointer at offset 0x34\n\nReturns:\n- Result from entity callback function if executed, or 0 if validation failed",
