      "name": "ProcessTextData",
      "signature": "void ProcessTextData(int * pTextData)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Validates and processes text data structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate input pointer is not null\n2. Verify text data type field equals 4\n3. If text data has child element (offset 0x24), process it\n4. Process the main text data structure\n\nParameters:\n- pTextData (int*): Pointer to text data structure\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nNotes:\n- Asserts on null input or invalid type field\n- Type field (offset 0x00) must equal 4\n- Child element pointer at offset 0x24",
