      "name": "SetTextBoxValues",
      "signature": "void SetTextBoxValues(int * pTextData, int nField1, int nField2)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets two fields in a validated D2WIN text box structure at offsets 0x28 and 0x29.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Assert pTextData is not NULL\n2. Assert pTextData->eType == 4 (D2WIN_TEXTBOX)\n3. Store nField1 at offset 0x28 (40)\n4. Store nField2 at offset 0x29 (41)\n5. Return 1 on success\n\nParameters:\n- pTextData (int*): Pointer to D2WIN text box structure\n- nField1 (int): Value for offset 0x28\n- nField2 (int): Value for offset 0x29\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success (does not return on assertion failure)",
