      "name": "TextBoxAddText",
      "signature": "int TextBoxAddText(int * pTextData, wchar_t * wszText, dword dwContext, byte byNewLine)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Adds text to a textbox control with word-wrapping support.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate text data structure type matches expected format (type 4)\n2. Initialize local Unicode buffer by calling constructor on each element\n3. Process input text character-by-character, stripping unsupported characters\n4. If text fits on current line, append to text node list\n5. If text overflows, split at last space and recursively process remainder\n6. Calculate text dimensions and manage vertical scrolling via scrollbar\n7. Handle CJK font height adjustments for Chinese/Korean/Japanese locales\n\nParameters:\n- pTextData (int*): Pointer to TextData structure (must be type 4)\n- wszText (wchar_t*): Unicode text string to append\n- dwContext (dword): Context value stored in text node\n- fNewLine (byte): If 1, new paragraph; if 0, append to previous line\n\nReturns:\n- Always returns 1 on success (assertions on invalid input)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:35470cf7e5b7404d094bfd3d830b5337",
