      "name": "TextSetLineColor",
      "signature": "dword TextSetLineColor(int * ptTextData, int nLineNum, dword dwColor)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Sets a color value for a specific text line or all lines in a text control.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate ptTextData pointer is not NULL (crash if NULL)\n2. Validate ptTextData[0] == 4 (text type marker)\n3. If nLineNum == -1: apply color to all lines by traversing linked list starting at ptTextData[0x12]\n4. If nLineNum >= 0: validate line index < ptTextData[0x15], traverse to target line, apply color\n5. Set color at line offset 0x14, return 1 on success\n\nParameters:\n- ptTextData (int*): Pointer to text control structure\n- nLineNum (int): Line index (-1 for all lines)\n- dwColor (dword): Color value to apply\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Success (color applied to line(s))\n- Calls FUN_6f91436d(0xffffffff) on validation failure (no return)\n\nStructure Layout:\n- [0x12]: Pointer to first line node\n- [0x14]: Line color value (offset within line)\n- [0x15]: Total line count\n- [0x1c]: Next line pointer (within line node)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
