      "name": "HandleTextListKeyNavigation",
      "signature": "int HandleTextListKeyNavigation(int * pUIObject)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Handles keyboard navigation input for text list UI controls.\n\nClassification: Callback/Handler - stored at UIObject offset 0x0C when dwOptions & 1.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pUIObject pointer is non-null (assert pParams->window)\n2. Validate object type equals 4 (TextDataType assertion)\n3. Check visibility bits via gdwBitMasks_exref offsets 0 and 8\n4. Check item count at offset 0x54 (piVar1[0x15]) is >= 1\n5. Check selection index at offset 0x60 (piVar1[0x18]) is not -1\n6. Call GetLastInputTime() - return 0 if input recently processed\n7. Cache scroll position (offset 0x58), selection (0x60), item count (0x54)\n8. Calculate visible row count using font metrics:\n   - SetActiveFont with font ID from offset 0x94\n   - Apply CJK font height adjustment for locales 7 (Chinese) and 9 (Korean)\n   - visibleRows = (height - 2*margin - charHeight) / (fontHeight + CJKOffset)\n9. Switch on key code at pUIObject[2]:\n   - 0x21 (VK_PRIOR/Page Up): Scroll up by visible rows\n   - 0x22 (VK_NEXT/Page Down): Scroll down by visible rows  \n   - 0x23 (VK_END): Jump to last item\n   - 0x24 (VK_HOME): Jump to first item\n   - 0x26 (VK_UP): Move selection up one row\n   - 0x28 (VK_DOWN): Move selection down one row\n10. Update selection index at offset 0x60\n11. If scroll position changed, call ScrollbarNavigateToIndex\n12. If selection changed and callback at offset 0x34 exists, invoke it\n13. Return 0\n\nParameters:\n- pUIObject (int *): Pointer to UI object structure, key code at [2]\n\nReturns:\n- 0: Always returns 0 (navigation handled)\n\nUI Object Structure Offsets Used:\nOffset  Field               Description\n0x00    pChildWindow        Pointer to child window structure\n0x08    dwFlags             Visibility/state flags\n0x18    nY                  Y position\n0x34    pfnSelectionChanged Selection change callback  \n0x44    nHeight             Control height\n0x54    nItemCount          Total items in list\n0x58    nScrollPosition     Current scroll offset\n0x60    nSelectedIndex      Currently selected item (-1 = none)\n0x94    nFontId             Font identifier\n\nVirtual Key Codes:\n0x21 = VK_PRIOR (Page Up)\n0x22 = VK_NEXT (Page Down)\n0x23 = VK_END\n0x24 = VK_HOME\n0x26 = VK_UP\n0x28 = VK_DOWN\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns early (0) if control invisible, empty, or no selection\n- Returns early if GetLastInputTime() returns non-zero (rate limiting)\n- CJK locales (7=Chinese, 9=Korean) use adjusted font height calculation\n- Selection callback at offset 0x34 only invoked when selection actually changes\n\nNote: Function body in Ghidra is truncated (1 instruction). Decompiler follows\nundefined bytes to reveal full logic. Full disassembly unavailable.",
