      "name": "SetAsyncFileHandleWithFallback",
      "signature": "dword SetAsyncFileHandleWithFallback(void * pHandle, dword dwFileData, dword * pdwOutParam, int nIgnoreError)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Sets async file handle with optional error ignoring fallback.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calls SetAsyncFileHandle with provided file data\n2. If successful, returns 1\n3. If failed, gets error code from GetLastError\n4. If nIgnoreError is set and error is 0x2 (FILE_NOT_FOUND), ignores error and returns 0\n5. Otherwise calls FogAssertWithHandle to report fatal error\n\nParameters:\n- pHandle (void*): File handle\n- dwFileData (dword): File data to set\n- pdwOutParam (dword*): Output parameter for result\n- nIgnoreError (int): Flag to ignore FILE_NOT_FOUND errors (2)\n\nReturns:\n- 1 if SetAsyncFileHandle succeeded\n- 0 if failed but error was ignored (FILE_NOT_FOUND when nIgnoreError is set)\n- Does not return on fatal error (calls FUN_6f91436d)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x2: FILE_NOT_FOUND error code\n- 0x3b (59): Line number in source file",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:86bcdcac87a71dad3a459eaa0c144da6",
