      "comment": "Closes an open MPQ archive and releases associated resources.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if handle is non-null\n2. Close the archive handle via SFileCloseArchive\n3. Clear the handle pointer\n4. Release pooled memory allocation\n\nParameters:\n- pMpqHandle (void**): Pointer to MPQ archive handle to close\n\nReturns:\n- void",
