      "name": "InitializeCodePageLocale",
      "signature": "int InitializeCodePageLocale(int nCodePageType)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Initialize MBCS character class table for specified code page.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Acquire critical section lock (index 0x19)\n2. Resolve code page type (-3=ACP, -2=OEM, -4=default, else literal)\n3. If same as current code page, return 0 (already initialized)\n4. Search known code page table for predefined character ranges\n5. If found: populate abCharacterClassTable from predefined ranges\n6. If not found: call GetCPInfo() to get lead byte ranges\n7. For MBCS: mark lead bytes with 0x04 flag, all bytes with 0x08 flag\n8. Store code page metadata (locale ID, info fields)\n9. Release critical section and return status\n\nParameters:\n- nCodePageType (int): Code page specifier (-3=ANSI, -2=OEM, -4=default, or literal code page)\n\nReturns:\n- 0 on success\n- -1 (0xFFFFFFFF) on GetCPInfo failure when code page required\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x19: Critical section index for MBCS\n- 0x30: Stride of known code page table entries\n- 0x40: Size of character class table in DWORDs (256 bytes)\n- 0x04: Lead byte flag in character class\n- 0x08: MBCS byte flag in character class",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
